------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Common Setup: Fast Large Zpool with HDD

- 4 high-speed 1-8TB HDD in stripe or stripe+mirror

Special vdev options (for metadata and small files 128K-1MB):
- 2 SATA SSDs in mirror, OR
- 1 fast NVMe, OR
- 2 fast NVMe in mirror (best practice)

This setup provides low latency and good performance regardless of HDD usage.
                       
